+          <t indent="0" pn="section-11.3.1-1">The utf8str_mixed type is a string of UTF-8 characters, with a prefix
+that is case sensitive, a separator equal to '@', and a suffix that
+is fully qualified domain name.  Its primary use in NFS Version 4 is
+for naming principals identified in an Access Control Entry.</t>
